The bucket hit the bottom of the well with a splash and he waited for it to become submerged before turning the wooden crank to retrieve it.
Retrieving his water pouch from his pack @0 filled it, then took a greedy drink as the others prepared to do the same.�

entries.translation:
@4把水桶放進了井裡。
水桶「撲通」一聲沉到了井底，他等它完全沉入水中後，才轉動木製的絞盤把它拉上來。
